Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of form we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.82,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the wind to dry all the tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're braving the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to toss this\Nin the water or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you need to learn\Nyour own limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand firm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Team Faye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we were going to use\Nthat ship, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I enter the water, I'm\Nafraid my strength runs wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you made it outside, there's\Nno ship for you to escape on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is over the limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It had a good run, but my\Nwax can't help you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Venom demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell's judgment! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dammit, don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I have some clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's not just my wax!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That poison is spreading\Nover everything it touches!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a tidal wave of very bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was cool while it lasted. Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that does look pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear gunfire, but the fog's\Ntoo heavy to make out anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is driving me crazy, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they're plenty\Ncapable of stealing a ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but if the Marines delay them\Nlong enough, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're pretty far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they do nab a ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll have to drag it all the\Nway back here for us to get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan's probably going to\Ncatch up to us any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Straw Hat survived\Na fight with him once,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but nobody can stop Magellan,\Nand this is taking awfully long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Teen Bay! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them take the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did his arm just turn into a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Diced Ice Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an assassin from the West Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore they take that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to suffer that dishonor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the cannon sink it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so Jinbe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta run faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there, we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that\Nthing is, but holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't tell what the\Nheck's going on out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, a wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Eva?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare us like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, it's nappy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not nappy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a head injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared, I can't lose you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Still breathing, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, call from Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby transponder snare?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you reached the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, but Magellan's still after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're kind of running\Nout of places to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It took a while, but we do have a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon, but\NI need you to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump straight into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for you and\Nall of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize this is the clone belt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't have\Ntime to explain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Three. I need another\Nwax thingy. We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Either we drown or Medela destroys us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you trust that fish man anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably trying to curry\Nfavor with the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's his friends are my friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't let us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the water? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Sea Kings eat you and save me\Nthe trouble of cleaning up the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a drop of that poison will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Judgment once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as big as I can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One candle wall coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I got enough of your nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaaaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They pushed him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison is still seeping through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we gotta dive into the water after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Eva! Wake up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your fat head to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all tiny right now, and\Nyou're the strongest person here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, baby straw boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the wing thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it! Okey-doke. No!\NPlease! All right! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wade, you're not in your right mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't survive two minutes in those\Nwaters without a ship, and they know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody grab onto\NEva's face! Do what? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're trying to do, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something huge is under the\Nship. A swarm of sea kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We landed on something\Nlook down i can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,this how are we still\Nalive i'm glad you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me for making such\Nan outlandish request back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a school of whale sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jim Bay must have called them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that stupid poison guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't be fun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No more and fell down. torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I had almost given up hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not time to celebrate yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a struggle ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You whale sharks are awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better start treatment on Inazuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See what they've got\Nstashed in the sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never going back to that\Nhellhole as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, no more crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading home to be a family man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck it, diarrhea man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Resilient little insects. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Warden Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still chase them down. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Little do they know, for all their joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,they've merely leapt from one\Ncage straight into another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We have repaired the battery that was\Ndamaged by Koby in the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, let's open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna sink us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no way to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys, just let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a whole fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done well enough so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,since all of their high-ranking officers\Nhave been summoned to Marine Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're still outnumbered, and\Nthey won't let us go so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see how I see your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:18:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For filthy criminals such as you,\Nthe Gates of Justice will never open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to crash right\Ninto it! He can't! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Dancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that guy said!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now, shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep sailing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have lost your damn mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to get us killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate can come next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we putting up with this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a navy ship too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire back, you imbeciles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just about to see\Nthat on the cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, give them hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Captain. Foley!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gone! Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look on that! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do they think they're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They expect the gate to\Njust open like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan would have to hit\Nthe switch for them himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the poor fools missed\Nthe memo on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop to their song!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice! They're opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's\Ngoing on and I don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as we're not dead and I can save\Nthese! It's open! It's open! It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're escaping! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, hurry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who authorized this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you want to open the\NGates of Justice at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any reason to doubt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the prisoner's ship makes its\Nway through, I want you to close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't lost them\Nyet. Take the ship. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Magellan order this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anyone contacted the ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Something isn't right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, sir, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw the warden at\Nthe pier a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, he seemed as confused about\Nit as we are and just took off running.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I find out who's responsible\Nfor this, I'm gonna wring their neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, control room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you to open the gate of justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, a warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time you knew and that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't stop you bastard that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you you silly man\Ndidn't learn your lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the first time did you\Nhe was a fake all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to close the gate on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.81,0:22:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we can make it through in\Ntime that it'll slam in their faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll be free to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vaughn was with us just a second ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He helped us fight Eva,\Nand he helped us escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.16,0:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved me from that poison and\Ncheered for me the whole way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my friend, and you\Nwant to go without him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just leave him to die back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way anyone could make it,\Nwe've left immeasurable comrades behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back and fight Magellan\Nagain and risk losing even more friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we hadn't stayed\Nbehind to open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where would we be right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead or worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can get the gate\Nopen for you guys, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, your pretty little blue head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't doubt that you can\Nsucceed, but then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not ask silly questions, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But do me a favor and don't tell\NStrawboy until communications are cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.08,0:23:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Swans never die and never say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby transponder snails\Nhave limited coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the gate closes, you\Nwon't be able to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to mark the warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew memorizing your\Nface was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.46,0:24:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.26,0:24:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you're choking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.10,0:24:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And touch. Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,God! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you still hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.98,0:24:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.42,0:24:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jibe, you promised you weren't\Nfar to tell him until later!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last thing I wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.36,0:24:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to break\Nout together, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do you\Nhave to save me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was there! Say something! Answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.42,0:24:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he stayed behind in that\Nhell. Come on! Brother, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.76,0:24:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us know you're alive, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.82,0:24:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:24:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dare you, Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.64,0:25:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I can tell you, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.64,0:25:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.72,0:25:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bond boy! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get through that gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow them to smotheries!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.82,0:25:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.06,0:25:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate's about to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:25:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.66,0:26:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Five days! Save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't look bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.96,0:26:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.04,0:26:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep hiring!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.34,0:26:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you miss me, old pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.54,0:26:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.45,0:26:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.37,0:26:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.72,0:26:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop pulling my tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.26,0:26:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy, I've come here to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.38,0:27:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of our everlasting friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.52,0:27:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.32,0:27:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Swans never die and never say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.18,0:27:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe him our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.92,0:27:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.00,0:27:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for him, we'd be sitting\Nat the bottom of the ocean right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.82,0:27:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the depths of hell, the flower\Nof friendship shall still bloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.34,0:27:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,flames licking at its stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.82,0:27:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the sands of the river\Nwhere souls part from the living,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:28:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it sheds a solitary petal,\Nleaving it behind as a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.60,0:28:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us vow that we shall\Nmake it bloom again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words before I eliminate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us meet again in the\Ngarden of O Come My Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.44,0:28:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in one fell swoop,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of prisoners that had escaped\Nfrom Impel Down jumped from 1 to 241.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.00,0:28:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this is only the beginning of a turn of\Nevents that will shake the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.38,0:28:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The public execution of Portgas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.14,0:29:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace will take place in four hours.
